			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Add serde_json::json macro import to MountainVinegRPCService\n\nAdd serde_json::json macro to the imports in MountainVinegRPCService to enable JSON construction for gRPC message handling. This supports building structured JSON payloads for the Vine protocol service layer.",
			"SHA": "ad4e95c0f1fc66068350e847e17d4d7e1b30ba63"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:44:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Handle extension registration notifications from Cocoon\n\nAdd three new notification handlers in MountainVinegRPCService to process messages from the Cocoon extension host:\n1. **window.showMessage**: Forward info/warn/error messages from extensions to the Sky UI layer via `sky://notification/show` Tauri event\n2. **registerCommand**: Store proxied extension commands in CommandRegistry with \"cocoon-main\" sidecar identifier, enabling Wind to route command execution back to Cocoon\n3. **Provider registration fallback**: Handle provider registration via the vscode API shim path (register_hover_provider, register_completion_item_provider, etc.) as a fallback for providers registered outside the typed RPC path\n\nThese handlers enable proper bidirectional communication between extensions running in Cocoon and the Mountain/Sky layers, completing the extension registration flow.",
			"SHA": "2a84003ca655e5474e91b38b583dff1ac856ee0f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:44:18Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Complete extension host context APIs and remaining language features\n\nCoordinate submodule updates to implement:\n\n1. **Cocoon**: Implement extension storage, secrets, and window messaging delegation to Mountain via gRPC. Real storage paths under ~/.codeeditorland for extension storage, globalStorage, and logs. Secrets API (get/store/delete) and window messages (showInformationMessage/showErrorMessage/showWarningMessage) now delegate to Mountain backend.\n\n2. **Mountain**: Implement all 14 remaining language feature provider methods replacing TODO stubs. Complete rename edits, document/workspace symbols, signature help, folding ranges, selection ranges, semantic tokens, inlay hints, type hierarchy (super/subtypes), call hierarchy (incoming/outgoing), linked editing ranges, and on-type formatting. Fix InsertText handling and DTO mapping for type/call hierarchy.\n\nThese changes enable full extension host capabilities including secure secret storage, native dialogs, persistent extension state, and complete language server functionality through the Mountain ↔ Cocoon gRPC bridge.",
			"SHA": "c10c44e8cc77ff2e594c28d6778dece95218622f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:27:03Z",
			"File": [
				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
